        <mxCell id="c97" value="&lt;b&gt;Missing details we found&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Luca needs the parking spot, otherwise he searches the whole yard. We added it to the queue and the details.&lt;br&gt;• The workflow did not define the order of the queue.&lt;br&gt;• It is open what Luca does if the car is damaged or not at its spot." style="shape=note;size=18;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;fontSize=12;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="490" width="830" height="138" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c98" value="&lt;b&gt;Group decisions&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• The queue is sorted by pickup time, earliest first.&lt;br&gt;• A rental leaves the queue once Luca marks it &amp;quot;Ready&amp;quot;.&lt;br&gt;• Reporting a problem with the car stays out of version 1. Luca tells Marco directly for now." style="shape=note;size=18;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;fontSize=12;fillColor=#DAE8FC;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;" vertex="1" parent="1">
