        <mxCell id="c129" value="&lt;b&gt;Missing details we found&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Nina needs to know where to find her rental number. We added a hint below the field.&lt;br&gt;• Anyone who guesses a rental number could see another customer&#39;s rental.&lt;br&gt;• The status word &amp;quot;Requested&amp;quot; means little to a customer." style="shape=note;size=18;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;fontSize=12;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="450" width="600" height="138" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c130" value="&lt;b&gt;Group decisions&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Nina sees the plate number, so she can find her car at the pickup area.&lt;br&gt;• For a customer we show &amp;quot;Being prepared&amp;quot; instead of &amp;quot;Requested&amp;quot;. The stored status stays the same.&lt;br&gt;• Open question for coaching: should Nina also enter her last name to protect her rental details?" style="shape=note;size=18;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;fontSize=12;fillColor=#DAE8FC;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;" vertex="1" parent="1">
